    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4383fbb0e6699a1c",
      "translationZh": "如果您有任何问题或反馈，我们很乐意在 Hugging Face 论坛上为您解答。感谢阅读！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
