    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "77f586dd9f850cad",
      "translationZh": "致谢：我们要感谢 Chaitanya Khened、Suyue Chen、Mikolaj Zyczynski、Wenjiao Yue、Wenxin Zhang、Letong Han、Sihan Chen、Hanwen Cheng、Yuan Wu 和 Yi Wang，感谢他们为在 Intel Gaudi 2 上构建企业级 RAG 系统所作出的杰出贡献。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f2eec252cc9b279",
      "translationZh": "基准测试配置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff1201af1bf000f8",
      "translationZh": "Gaudi2 配置：HLS-Gaudi2，配备八张 Habana Gaudi2 HL-225H 夹层卡、两颗 Intel® Xeon® Platinum 8380 CPU @ 2.30GHz，以及 1TB 系统内存；操作系统：Ubuntu 22.04.03，5.15.0 内核",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a401a07f8a6a7c7",
      "translationZh": "H100 SXM 配置：Lambda labs 实例 gpu_8x_h100_sxm5；8 张 H100 SXM、两颗 Intel Xeon® Platinum 8480 CPU@2 GHz，以及 1.8TB 系统内存；操作系统：ubuntu 20.04.6 LTS，5.15.0 内核",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3875020c8516681",
      "translationZh": "Intel Xeon：预量产 Granite Rapids 平台，配置为 2Sx120C @ 1.9GHz，配备 8800 MCR DIMMs，系统内存为 1.5TB。操作系统：Cent OS 9，6.2.0 内核",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4785dd8282fd24a4",
      "translationZh": "Llama2 70B 部署在 4 张卡上（查询量按 8 张卡归一化）。Gaudi2 使用 BF16，H100 使用 FP16。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c55bfb94e2669558",
      "translationZh": "嵌入模型为 BAAI/bge-base v1.5。测试使用：TGI-gaudi 1.2.1、TGI-GPU 1.4.5 Python 3.11.7、Langchain 0.1.11、sentence-transformers 2.5.1、langchain benchmarks 0.0.10、redis 5.0.2、cuda 12.2.r12.2/compiler.32965470 0、TEI 1.2.0，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "68594e823fe7bfd0",
      "translationZh": "RAG 查询的最大输入长度为 1024，最大输出长度为 128。测试数据集：langsmith Q&A。并发客户端数量为 16",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0eca87a6741901b4",
      "translationZh": "Gaudi2（70B）的 TGI 参数：batch_bucket_size=22, prefill_batch_bucket_size=4, max_batch_prefill_tokens=5102, max_batch_total_tokens=32256, max_waiting_tokens=5, streaming=false",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c6db1ddf8d6743cc",
      "translationZh": "H100（70B）的 TGI 参数：batch_bucket_size=8, prefill_batch_bucket_size=4, max_batch_prefill_tokens=4096, max_batch_total_tokens=131072, max_waiting_tokens=20, max_batch_size=128, streaming=false",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
